{"research_date": "2026-09-10", "pairs": [{"pair_id": "conflict_3006918365a6040d0e6eb4c7", "claim_ids": ["claim_a46c5248a7d6bbd1804050c6", "claim_da5050a10fdf74974a04d1f4"], "query_ids": ["q_449"], "claims": [{"claim_id": "claim_a46c5248a7d6bbd1804050c6", "quote": "Presidential Proclamation 10908 (effective April 3, 2025) imposed a 25% tariff on passenger vehicles classified under HTS heading 8703", "url": "https://gingercontrol.com/blog/hts-classification-auto-parts", "kind": "full_document", "publisher_type": "secondary_or_unverified_publisher", "fields": {"tariff_program": "Section 232 Auto Parts Tariff", "legal_authority": "Trade Expansion Act of 1962", "duty_rate": "25%", "effective_date": "April 3, 2025", "reported_policy_status": "imposed"}}, {"claim_id": "claim_da5050a10fdf74974a04d1f4", "quote": "Presidential Proclamation 10908, \"Adjusting Imports of Automobiles and Certain Automobile Parts Into the United States,\" March 2025. Imposed a 25% tariff on passenger vehicles under HTS heading 8703, effective April 3, 2025.", "url": "https://gingercontrol.com/blog/hts-classification-auto-parts", "kind": "full_document", "publisher_type": "secondary_or_unverified_publisher", "fields": {"duty_rate": "25%", "effective_date": "April 3, 2025", "reported_policy_status": "Imposed"}}]}, {"pair_id": "conflict_316b0cfac3e8ebe3690def07", "claim_ids": ["claim_36c0db4091ca69829051efff", "claim_f598287e36856d2ffddaba7e"], "query_ids": ["q_450"], "claims": [{"claim_id": "claim_36c0db4091ca69829051efff", "quote": "However, a federal register notice published on April 3 clarifies the tariff on automotive parts — which includes engines and engine parts, transmissions and powertrain parts, and electrical components — will not apply until May 3.", "url": "https://www.supplychaindive.com/news/trump-automotive-tariffs/743656", "kind": "search_snippet", "publisher_type": "secondary_or_unverified_publisher", "fields": {"effective_date": "May 3"}}, {"claim_id": "claim_f598287e36856d2ffddaba7e", "quote": "The April 3 tariff applies to imported sedans, SUVs, crossovers, minivans, cargo vans and light trucks, according to a White House fact sheet.", "url": "https://www.supplychaindive.com/news/trump-automotive-tariffs/743656", "kind": "search_snippet", "publisher_type": "secondary_or_unverified_publisher", "fields": {"effective_date": "April 3"}}]}, {"pair_id": "conflict_cd3d800da898f2c88eac037b", "claim_ids": ["claim_64ffb7369144487aa926c21c", "claim_6695e1b10d831f211a3807e5"], "query_ids": ["q_450"], "claims": [{"claim_id": "claim_64ffb7369144487aa926c21c", "quote": "A 25% import tax is being applied to foreign vehicles, though a federal register notice clarifies foreign parts will be taxed at a later date.", "url": "https://www.supplychaindive.com/news/trump-automotive-tariffs/743656", "kind": "search_snippet", "publisher_type": "secondary_or_unverified_publisher", "fields": {"duty_rate": "25%", "effective_date": "begin"}}, {"claim_id": "claim_6695e1b10d831f211a3807e5", "quote": "While tariffs on automobiles are already in effect, tariffs on parts will be enacted “no later than May 3, 2025,” per the executive order.", "url": "https://www.cars.com/articles/how-trumps-proposed-25-tariffs-on-automobiles-automotive-parts-will-affect-you-506395", "kind": "search_snippet", "publisher_type": "secondary_or_unverified_publisher", "fields": {"tariff_program": "tariffs on parts", "effective_date": "no later than May 3, 2025", "reported_policy_status": "executive order"}}]}, {"pair_id": "conflict_79d1cb17a9eb0e4a3933649f", "claim_ids": ["claim_3e4052016b7c68f36bfa9156", "claim_6e963dc503769d35298e55bc"], "query_ids": ["q_451"], "claims": [{"claim_id": "claim_3e4052016b7c68f36bfa9156", "quote": "On March 26, the Trump Administration announced a 25 percent tariff on imports of automobiles and certain automotive parts. The tariff went into effect for fully assembled vehicles on April 3. The tariff on auto parts will go into effect on May 3.", "url": "https://www.asashop.org/2025/04/04/understanding-the-new-tariffs-and-their-potential-impact-on-auto-repairers", "kind": "full_document", "publisher_type": "secondary_or_unverified_publisher", "fields": {"tariff_program": "25 percent tariff on imports of automobiles and certain automotive parts", "effective_date": "April 3", "reported_policy_status": "announced"}}, {"claim_id": "claim_6e963dc503769d35298e55bc", "quote": "Since April 3, 2025, an additional 25 percent duty has applied to imports of motor vehicles. Since May 3, 2025, the same duty also applies to car parts.", "url": "https://www.customsmanager.info/post/us-tariffs-on-auto-parts-customs-manager", "kind": "full_document", "publisher_type": "secondary_or_unverified_publisher", "fields": {"tariff_program": "additional 25 percent duty", "effective_date": "April 3, 2025"}}]}, {"pair_id": "conflict_e92380a20a0fe84a6ce74ef8", "claim_ids": ["claim_88c54c312cd7a8bd7c1574eb", "claim_ce1a830657c56e2f0ffe6bbe"], "query_ids": ["q_451"], "claims": [{"claim_id": "claim_88c54c312cd7a8bd7c1574eb", "quote": "imposing a 25 percent ad valorem tariff on parts of passenger vehicles (sedans, sport utility vehicles, crossover utility vehicles, minivans, and cargo vans) and light trucks from all countries", "url": "https://content.govdelivery.com/accounts/USDHSCBP/bulletins/3de7ef9", "kind": "full_document", "publisher_type": "secondary_or_unverified_publisher", "fields": {"tariff_program": "Section 232", "duty_rate": "25 percent ad valorem", "effective_date": "May 3, 2025"}}, {"claim_id": "claim_ce1a830657c56e2f0ffe6bbe", "quote": "Cars from Canada or Mexico are not automatically exempt. The 25 percent duty applies only to non-US components.", "url": "https://www.customsmanager.info/post/us-tariffs-on-auto-parts-customs-manager", "kind": "full_document", "publisher_type": "secondary_or_unverified_publisher", "fields": {}}]}, {"pair_id": "conflict_0a205af41fd7e0f6ee531b99", "claim_ids": ["claim_728023eebe3c5912ecddbe54", "claim_dbc0103d92bf79647ea9341c"], "query_ids": ["q_454"], "claims": [{"claim_id": "claim_728023eebe3c5912ecddbe54", "quote": "In 2024 and early 2025, renewed scrutiny over China’s tech exports—especially components seen as key to U.S. industries—has led to potential reinstatement or reclassification of duties under Section 301 of the Trade Act.", "url": "https://microtipsusa.com/navigating-u-s-tariffs-understanding-monitoring-and-minimizing-risk-for-tft-lcd-display-imports-from-china", "kind": "full_document", "publisher_type": "secondary_or_unverified_publisher", "fields": {"tariff_program": "Section 301 of the Trade Act", "reported_policy_status": "potential reinstatement or reclassification"}}, {"claim_id": "claim_dbc0103d92bf79647ea9341c", "quote": "TFT LCDs have at times been included in tariff lists, with duties ranging from 7.5% to 25% depending on classification.", "url": "https://microtipsusa.com/navigating-u-s-tariffs-understanding-monitoring-and-minimizing-risk-for-tft-lcd-display-imports-from-china", "kind": "full_document", "publisher_type": "secondary_or_unverified_publisher", "fields": {"tariff_program": "Section 301 of the Trade Act", "duty_rate": "7.5% to 25%", "effective_date": "2018"}}]}, {"pair_id": "conflict_3804347a5bce362bc234acbf", "claim_ids": ["claim_8cf0a6112e2c2bf146c0ca47", "claim_ffb63b84c66c83e2e7f3e1d6"], "query_ids": ["q_456"], "claims": [{"claim_id": "claim_8cf0a6112e2c2bf146c0ca47", "quote": "In 2025, President Donald Trump imposed 25% tariffs on U.S. imports of automobiles and certain automobile parts under Section 232.", "url": "https://www.congress.gov/crs-product/IN12545", "kind": "search_snippet", "publisher_type": "secondary_or_unverified_publisher", "fields": {"tariff_program": "Section 232", "duty_rate": "25%", "effective_date": "2025", "reported_policy_status": "imposed"}}, {"claim_id": "claim_ffb63b84c66c83e2e7f3e1d6", "quote": "President Trump imposed25% tariffs on (1) all vehicle imports, effective April 2025, with exemptions for the U.S. content of USMCA-compliant vehicles; and (2) certain automobile parts, effective May 2025, with exemptions for USMCA-compliant auto parts.", "url": "https://www.congress.gov/crs-product/IN12545", "kind": "search_snippet", "publisher_type": "secondary_or_unverified_publisher", "fields": {"duty_rate": "25%", "effective_date": "April 2025"}}]}, {"pair_id": "conflict_2da1361701ea4fcc166400de", "claim_ids": ["claim_aae340ff52f3a36cdc438396", "claim_b85440da73598fcef57182bf"], "query_ids": ["q_456"], "claims": [{"claim_id": "claim_aae340ff52f3a36cdc438396", "quote": "Pursuant to President Donald J. Trump’s proclamation on March 26, 2025, 25% tariffs on imports of automobile parts went into effect on May 3, 2025.", "url": "https://www.trade.gov/press-release/department-commerce-announces-new-auto-tariff-offset-process", "kind": "full_document", "publisher_type": "official_trade_authority", "fields": {"tariff_program": "Section 232 tariffs", "duty_rate": "25%", "effective_date": "May 3, 2025"}}, {"claim_id": "claim_b85440da73598fcef57182bf", "quote": "Only auto parts for passenger vehicles and light trucks, as defined by Executive Order 14257, issued April 2, 2025, and subject to Section 232 duties as of May 3, 2025, are not subject to the reciprocal duties effective April 5, 2025, pursuant to heading 9903.01.33, HTSUS.", "url": "https://www.cbp.gov/trade/programs-administration/entry-summary/section-232-additional-faqs-autos", "kind": "full_document", "publisher_type": "official_trade_authority", "fields": {"tariff_program": "Section 232 duties", "affected_product": "auto parts for passenger vehicles and light trucks", "hts_code": "9903.01.33, HTSUS", "effective_date": "May 3, 2025", "reported_policy_status": "not subject to the reciprocal duties effective April 5, 2025"}}]}, {"pair_id": "conflict_c6ab25d72b7e424763144248", "claim_ids": ["claim_6ab4d6ddffbf06994f5e6082", "claim_b85440da73598fcef57182bf"], "query_ids": ["q_456"], "claims": [{"claim_id": "claim_6ab4d6ddffbf06994f5e6082", "quote": "Heading 9903.01.33, HTSUS, exempting products subject to Section 232 from the reciprocal tariffs, applies to auto parts for passenger vehicles and light trucks.", "url": "https://www.cbp.gov/trade/programs-administration/entry-summary/section-232-additional-faqs-autos", "kind": "full_document", "publisher_type": "official_trade_authority", "fields": {"tariff_program": "Section 232", "affected_product": "auto parts for passenger vehicles and light trucks", "hts_code": "9903.01.33, HTSUS"}}, {"claim_id": "claim_b85440da73598fcef57182bf", "quote": "Only auto parts for passenger vehicles and light trucks, as defined by Executive Order 14257, issued April 2, 2025, and subject to Section 232 duties as of May 3, 2025, are not subject to the reciprocal duties effective April 5, 2025, pursuant to heading 9903.01.33, HTSUS.", "url": "https://www.cbp.gov/trade/programs-administration/entry-summary/section-232-additional-faqs-autos", "kind": "full_document", "publisher_type": "official_trade_authority", "fields": {"tariff_program": "Section 232 duties", "affected_product": "auto parts for passenger vehicles and light trucks", "hts_code": "9903.01.33, HTSUS", "effective_date": "May 3, 2025", "reported_policy_status": "not subject to the reciprocal duties effective April 5, 2025"}}]}, {"pair_id": "conflict_59d1dfa01c4ebd3b6029d363", "claim_ids": ["claim_d657e93da637a61c8c10690c", "claim_ffb63b84c66c83e2e7f3e1d6"], "query_ids": ["q_456"], "claims": [{"claim_id": "claim_d657e93da637a61c8c10690c", "quote": "Yes, parts of automobiles that qualify for preferential tariff treatment under USMCA, self-certified by importers to be used for automobile production or repair activity in the United States, are eligible to use HTS 9903.94.06.", "url": "https://www.cbp.gov/trade/programs-administration/entry-summary/section-232-additional-faqs-autos", "kind": "full_document", "publisher_type": "official_trade_authority", "fields": {"tariff_program": "USMCA", "affected_product": "parts of automobiles", "hts_code": "9903.94.06"}}, {"claim_id": "claim_ffb63b84c66c83e2e7f3e1d6", "quote": "President Trump imposed25% tariffs on (1) all vehicle imports, effective April 2025, with exemptions for the U.S. content of USMCA-compliant vehicles; and (2) certain automobile parts, effective May 2025, with exemptions for USMCA-compliant auto parts.", "url": "https://www.congress.gov/crs-product/IN12545", "kind": "search_snippet", "publisher_type": "secondary_or_unverified_publisher", "fields": {"duty_rate": "25%", "effective_date": "April 2025"}}]}]}

